extraction_notes: |
  - Rifts Conversion Book One printed 79-80 (file p080-p081). The Rifts conversion of the Palladium Fantasy Coyle, which is the `coyle` row. A separate class because a variant cannot cross systems.
  - The S.D.C. here is 20 - "20 plus those gained from the O.C.C. (typically 25-30 for Men at Arms) and physical skills" - where the Palladium Fantasy row carries 10. Stored as a POOL BONUS.
